# REQUIREMENTS: cu-005

CU-005 keeps Kafka between stages and orchestrates the pipeline: KafkaRawPublisher publishes fetched RssItems as circe JSON to the raw Kafka topic (idempotent producer, key = guid); IngestionService.runOnce(now) fetches, publishes raw, dedups on BronzeUnit.idFor (cu-001), enriches the remainder (Left becomes Enrichment.empty with a warn log and never fails the batch), and appends BronzeUnits via BronzeSink, returning the written count. Application code imports ONLY newspipe.domain. Requires cu-001 (models, ports); consumes cu-002/cu-003/cu-004 implementations. This CU satisfies feat-1 criterion 6 (Kafka + Spark preserved between stages).
